    "notes": [
      "Depends on the landed Phase 39 deterministic XPI generation and SAF export overlay.",
      "Compose and generated Firefox CSS consume XdmThemeTokenCatalog as one Dark and AMOLED palette, shape, and motion source.",
      "Follow app resolves at XPI generation time; an app-theme change marks the previous export stale and offers deterministic regeneration.",
      "The previous page card is replaced by a 56 px safe-area-aware Shadow DOM FAB with candidate, HLS/DASH, accessibility, reduced-motion, and fullscreen contracts.",
      "The working Phase 37 in-page custom-scheme anchors and credential-thin payload are preserved without expansion.",
      "No top-level route, Room migration, transfer-engine behavior, app version, or Android browser runtime is introduced."
